cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file,
  and cite the accompanying paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
title: >-
  eigenvalues-line-matlab: Discrete sine transform based computation of
  Sturm–Liouville eigenvalues
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of a discrete sine transform (DST) based method for the
  eigenvalues of the one-dimensional Sturm–Liouville operator on an interval
  with homogeneous Dirichlet boundary conditions, together with
  finite-difference, Numerov, Chebyshev and Legendre–Galerkin implementations
  used for comparison, and reference eigenvalues computed with MATSLISE.
